/td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C0480" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C06E0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C0940"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C0BA0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C1050"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C12B0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C1510"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C1770" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C1FA0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C2200" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear Agency Partner,</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C26C0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C2920" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C2DE0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C3040" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for reaching out to us via the NDC Technology Support Contact Us form.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186BFB40"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C32A0">From our investigation, it appears that this is a technical issue that requires the assistance of your Technology Partner. To investigate this matter further, we will require the assistance of your Technology Partner.&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C34E0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C35F0">Please reach out to your Technology Partner to inform them of the issue. Once you have a Technology Partner case number, please kindly respond to this email with the case so we can continue the investigation with your Technical Partner.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C3830"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C3940">We look forward to hearing back from you.<br><br>For more information on Qantas NDC and frequently asked questions, please visit <a href="https://help.qantas.com/agencyconnect/s/topic/0TOMo000000MuMvOAK/qantas-ndc">NDC FAQs</a><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C3B80"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C3C90">Kind regards,<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C3ED0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C3FE0"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C4220">Qantas NDC Escalation Support</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C4480"><em data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C46C0">Qantas Airways Limited</em></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C4CB0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C4F10" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C53D0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C5630" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C7100"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C7360" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000186C75C0" 